  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Anita, Alex and Annabel Nicholson Memorial Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Anita, Alex and Annabel Nicholson lost their lives in the Sri Lanka bombings on Easter Sunday 2019. The Anita, Alex and Annabel Nicholson Memorial Fund has had enormous support in their memory and is being used to create a legacy to the optimistic and positives lives they led.  Our partner projects across Asia are creating a safe,fun environment where children can be themselves, with high quality education,health,well being and inclusion at the core. All of this is done with the ethos of rugby.</narrative>
  </description>
